WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.901
Open Inbound entry points, and click Add.

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:07.349
Choose Voice calls.

00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:11.577
Name the entry point, and pick the number it answers under Numbers.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:16.210
The numbers come from Omnichannel Addresses that are used for voice calls.

00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:19.491
On Routing, Route to has three choices:

00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:21.817
Queue, Specific agent, and A.I.

00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:22.948
voice agent.

00:00:22.948 --> 00:00:27.473
The last one appears when the Telnyx AI Voice Agent feature is on.

00:00:27.473 --> 00:00:29.296
Choose it, and the A.I.

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:30.993
agent picker appears.

00:00:31.446 --> 00:00:33.916
The picker lists your chat profiles.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:38.855
Saving without one is refused, with a message that asks you to select the A.I.

00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:41.796
agent that answers this entry point's calls.

00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:43.736
Pick the profile, and save.

